WEBVTT

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:32.018
"Should I go to the trial
and see the driver?

00:12:32.042 --> 00:12:34.768
Would that help me or would it harm me?"

00:12:34.792 --> 00:12:36.684
Well, that was a no-brainer for me,

00:12:36.708 --> 00:12:38.559
I chose to stay away.

00:12:38.583 --> 00:12:41.309
But Trevor, my husband,
decided to meet with the driver

00:12:41.333 --> 00:12:43.101
at a later time.

00:12:43.125 --> 00:12:48.476
Late at night, I'd find myself sometimes
poring over old photos of Abi,

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:50.476
getting more and more upset.

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:51.768
I'd ask myself,

00:12:51.792 --> 00:12:55.476
"Really? Is this helping you
or is it harming you?

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:57.143
Put away the photos,

00:12:57.167 --> 00:12:58.768
go to bed for the night,

00:12:58.792 --> 00:13:00.792
be kind to yourself."